<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line ltx_leqno">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">Instruction-aware User Embedding via Synergistic Language and Representation Modeling</h1>
<span class="ltx_pubnotes ltx_pubnotes_meta"><span class="ltx_pubnotes_content"><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_isbn"><span class="ltx_note_name">ISBN: </span>978-1-4503-XXXX-X/2018/06</span><span class="ltx_pubnote ltx_role_ccs"><span class="ltx_note_name">CCS: </span>Information systems Collaborative filtering</span></span></span>
